1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,100
Slide 24 diagrams "NATIVE CROSS-APP PIPELINES: Harmonizing Google Workspace."

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,343
Look at the automated journey on screen: a client sends an inquiry email to Gmail.

3
00:00:14,343 --> 00:00:21,120
An Apps Script trigger catches the message and dispatches a JSON webhook to Spark OS in 50 milliseconds.

4
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:35,800
Gemini 3.5 Flash parses the client's request, checks your pricing rate card in Google Sheets, queries client project history in Google Drive, drafts a customized proposal in Google Docs, and blocks a tentative meeting slot on your Google Calendar!

5
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:40,920
And how long does that entire 4-app workflow take, James?

6
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,970
Exactly 12 seconds in the cloud!

7
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:51,900
In the old days, an account manager would take 45 minutes of manual copy-pasting between five browser tabs to do that!

8
00:00:52,800 --> 00:01:01,680
And with zero typos, zero pricing calculation errors, and an immutable SHA-256 audit log committed to SQLite!

9
00:01:02,580 --> 00:01:09,320
Unified workspace pipelines turn scattered tools into a synchronized symphony of productivity.

